# Feature completion gate

When creating or updating a feature (App Router pages, components, server actions, auth, admin UI, audit, landing CTAs, schema touching product behavior), do **not** consider the work done until all of the following are finished in the same change:

1. **Feature docs** — update or add `docs/<feature>.md` (see `feature-docs` rule). Keep paths and function names accurate.
2. **QA test cases** — update or add `docs/qa/<feature>.test-cases.md` (see `feature-testing` rule).
3. **Verification commands** — run and fix failures before stopping:

```bash
pnpm exec tsc --noEmit
pnpm lint
pnpm test
pnpm build
```

(`pnpm test` may be skipped only for pure docs/copy edits with no logic change; typecheck, lint, and build still run when any `src/` file changed.)

UI-only role hiding is not enough — keep server guards (`requireSession` / `requireAdmin` + Zod) per `feature-security`.

Prefer the **feature-workflow** project skill for the full ordered checklist.
